# ─── Model Checkpoints & Large Binaries ──────────────────────────────────────
# Ignore all model weights and large binaries globally
**/*.pt
**/*.pth
**/*.onnx
**/*.tflite
**/*.ckpt
**/*.pb
**/*.weights
**/*.h5

# ─── Media & Archives ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
**/*.mp4
**/*.avi
**/*.mov
**/*.mkv
**/*.zip
**/*.tar
**/*.tar.gz
**/*.rar
**/*.7z
**/*.gif

# Allow assets for README/demo
!assets/**/*.mp4
!assets/**/*.gif
!assets/**/*.png
!assets/**/*.jpg

# ─── AutoSegmentor runtime / working dirs ────────────────────────────────────
**/working_dir/
**/outputs/
**/temp/
**/VideoInputs/
**/Video*_Export*/

